{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CgD2rSrNjY4cSQvPkP4r7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019qhPutAQhu9gtYed3XbehR","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Audit cinescope implementation against spec","prompt":"You are auditing a completed implementation of a cinema seat-booking web app against its written spec. This is a verification pass, not an implementation task — do NOT edit any files, only read and report.\n\nContext: The app lives at /workspace/project/apps/cinescope/src. The full specification is at /workspace/project/spec/README.md (674 lines) with section 9 listing every required data-testid and section 10 listing acceptance criteria AC-01 through AC-69 (approximately). Tickets in /workspace/project/spec/tickets/01 through 07 break down the work; 07-final-pass.md describes this exact verification step.\n\nKey implementation files to check against the spec:\n- src/app/app.tsx (routes)\n- src/api.ts, src/types.ts (backend integration)\n- src/dateUtils.ts, src/seatUtils.ts, src/booking.ts (core logic)\n- src/toast/ToastProvider.tsx\n- src/pages/MovieListPage/{MovieListPage.tsx,DayPicker.tsx}\n- src/pages/SeatSelectionPage/{SeatSelectionPage.tsx,AuditoriumMap.tsx,AuditoriumMap.scss,Legend.tsx,SelectedSeatsPanel.tsx}\n- src/pages/SummaryPage/SummaryPage.tsx\n- src/pages/CheckoutPage/{CheckoutPage.tsx,checkoutValidation.ts}\n- src/pages/ConfirmationPage/ConfirmationPage.tsx\n\nPlease do the following and report back concisely (a punch list, not prose):\n1. Read spec/README.md in full, focusing especially on section 9 (data-testid inventory) and section 10 (acceptance criteria).\n2. Read each ticket file in spec/tickets/ to confirm there's no requirement mentioned there that isn't also reflected in README.md (tickets should just be a breakdown of the same spec).\n3. Cross-check every data-testid named in spec section 9 against actual occurrences in the src files listed above (grep for data-testid across the whole src tree). Report any spec testid that is MISSING from the code, and any testid naming MISMATCH (e.g. spec says `seat-count` but code has `selected-seats-count`).\n4. Go through acceptance criteria section 10 one by one and mark each as PASS (clearly satisfied by reading the code), FAIL (clearly violated), or UNCLEAR (requires runtime behavior you can't confirm by static reading, e.g. visual layout, exact pixel widths, hover behavior details — just note these as \"needs manual/browser verification\").\n5. Note any other direct spec requirement (not tied to a specific data-testid or AC number) that looks unmet.\n\nReport format: a compact list of concrete discrepancies only (missing testids, mismatched testids, failed ACs with the specific line/reason). If everything checks out, say so plainly. Do not restate things that are correct — only flag problems or genuinely unclear/unverifiable items. Keep the report under 600 words.","subagent_type":"Explore","run_in_background":false},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1431,"cache_read_input_tokens":92354,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1431},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3632df4e-836a-4239-9ca1-2c0c9dc67b92","uuid":"cb697f8c-7394-4685-a758-3d734381e33c","timestamp":"2026-10-20T06:41:32.985Z","request_id":"req_011CgD2rSLNaNWpgJ5bX7B3s","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_019qhPutAQhu9gtYed3XbehR":{"description":"Audit cinescope implementation against spec","prompt":"You are auditing a completed implementation of a cinema seat-booking web app against its written spec. This is a verification pass, not an implementation task — do NOT edit any files, only read and report.\n\nContext: The app liv